#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Aiuto"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Defend yourself agains all alien attacks."
msgstr "Difenditi da tutti gli attacchi alieni."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Defense"
msgstr "Defense"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Defend against all enemy attacks"
msgstr "Difenditi da tutti gli attacchi nemici"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "General idea"
msgstr "Idea generale"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The range of your cannon is about 40m. The category of the enemies is "
"<code>AlienAnt</code>. Turn towards the closest ant, even if it is still "
"more than 40m away. But shoot only when it is closer than 40m, in order not "
"to waste your energy."
msgstr ""
"Il cannone ha una portata di circa 40 m. I nemici appartengono alla "
"categoria <code>AlienAnt</code>. Girati verso la formica più vicina anche se"
" si trova a più di 40 m, ma spara soltanto quando è a meno di 40 m, per non "
"sprecare energia."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Useful instructions"
msgstr "Istruzioni utili"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|radar>radar</a></code> to detect your enemies (category <code><a object|ant>AlienAnt</a></code>)\n"
"<code><a cbot|direct>direction</a></code> to calculate a direction\n"
"<code><a cbot|dist>distance</a></code> to calculate a distance\n"
"<code><a cbot|fire>fire</a></code> to fire your cannon\n"
"<code><a cbot|wait>wait</a></code> to wait"
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|radar>radar</a></code> per individuare i nemici (categoria <code><a object|ant>AlienAnt</a></code>)\n"
"<code><a cbot|direct>direction</a></code> per calcolare una direzione\n"
"<code><a cbot|dist>distance</a></code> per calcolare una distanza\n"
"<code><a cbot|fire>fire</a></code> per sparare\n"
"<code><a cbot|wait>wait</a></code> per attendere"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
